     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">fit a logistic regression to methylation values where explanatory variable is the treatment (case or control). Compare the fit of the model with explanatory variable vs the null model (no explanatory variable) see if the fit is better using a Chisq test. the logistic regression response variables (methylation values) are weighted by their coverage.<div><br></div><div>in your case NAs have no effect, they are not in the model<br><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
